{"title": "Psionic Empowerment", "pageid": 9084, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psionic_Empowerment", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/300px-Generic_Psychic.webp, /w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/300px-Generic_Psychic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Psionic Empowerment</b> is a passive feature that grants an extra 1d6 Psychic damage on attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your attacks deal an extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage - the scars of illithid enslavement run deep. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Add%27ath\" title=\"Add'ath\">Add'ath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ahu%27u%27rag\" title=\"Ahu'u'rag\">Ahu'u'rag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\">Baretha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bradi%27ith\" title=\"Bradi'ith\">Bradi'ith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brelal%27reth\" title=\"Brelal'reth\">Brelal'reth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ch%27guth\" title=\"Ch'guth\">Ch'guth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chost\" title=\"Chost\">Chost</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chy%27raagh\" title=\"Chy'raagh\">Chy'raagh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dor%27il\" title=\"Dor'il\">Dor'il</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Far%27aag\" title=\"Far'aag\">Far'aag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/For%27reth\" title=\"For'reth\">For'reth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/G%27nuril\" title=\"G'nuril\">G'nuril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/G%27r%27ath\" title=\"G'r'ath\">G'r'ath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghush%27ins\" title=\"Ghush'ins\">Ghush'ins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Helag\" title=\"Helag\">Helag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ith%27dul\" title=\"Ith'dul\">Ith'dul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">Jeera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jhe%27rezath\" title=\"Jhe'rezath\">Jhe'rezath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jy%27ir\" title=\"Jy'ir\">Jy'ir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kethk\" title=\"Kethk\">Kethk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kharyk\" title=\"Kharyk\">Kharyk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Khunaruth\" title=\"Khunaruth\">Khunaruth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ko%27kuu\" title=\"Ko'kuu\">Ko'kuu</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kur%27ashk\" title=\"Kur'ashk\">Kur'ashk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kyrr%27a%27ath\" title=\"Kyrr'a'ath\">Kyrr'a'ath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lin%27a%27an\" title=\"Lin'a'an\">Lin'a'an</a>,  <a h